      "hash64": "D920967370DEA2C8",
      "text": "嘿呀！對戰學的老師是我！\\n熱血沸騰的凰檗！！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
